  "lastWords" : "I filled the hole, and `check_file` reports success on the final file: exit code 0, no diagnostics and no holes left.\n\nThe proof works by induction on `m`:\n\n```agda\n+-comm zero n = sym (+-identityʳ n)\n+-comm (suc m) n rewrite +-suc n m = cong suc (+-comm m n)\n```\n\n- **When `m` is zero:** `+-identityʳ n` gives `n + 0 ≡ n`, and `sym` turns it around to the goal `0 + n ≡ n + 0`.\n- **When `m` is `suc m`:** rewriting with `+-suc n m` changes `n + suc m` to `suc (n + m)`. The goal becomes `suc (m + n) ≡ suc (n + m)`, which the induction hypothesis proves under `cong suc`.\n\nI only replaced the hole l",
